    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are a Quality Engineering Log Analyzer. Your sole job is to inspect automated test execution details and extract clear technical metadata and root-cause summaries.\n\nInstructions:\n1. Extract the primary failing component and class/method from the stack trace.\n2. Summarize the root cause in one concise, objective sentence describing what went wrong.\n3. Identify the failure domain (e.g., Payment Gateway, Pricing/Cart Logic, UI Selector Timeout, Database, Auth).\n4. Do NOT make any decisions about priority, severity, or ticketing actions.\n\nOutput ONLY valid JSON adhering to the requested schema.\nTest Case ID: {{ $json.test_case_id }}\nTest Name: {{ $json.test_name }}\nApplication: {{ $json.application }}\nEnvironment: {{ $json.environment }}\nError Type: {{ $json.error_type }}\nError Message: {{ $json.error_message }}\nStack Trace: {{ $json.stack_trace }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        80,
        -32
      ],
      "id": "0ccc4dc6-58fe-4649-a13b-428b92e06523",
      "name": "Extract"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Lead Quality Assurance & Site Reliability Specialist. Your job is to classify the priority and severity of a test failure based on extracted root-cause metadata.\n\nSTRICT CLASSIFICATION RULES:\n\n1. HIGH SEVERITY / HIGH PRIORITY:\n   - System crashes, unhandled exceptions (e.g., NullPointerException, PaymentGatewayException), 5xx API errors, or payment/checkout blockers.\n\n2. MEDIUM SEVERITY / MEDIUM PRIORITY:\n   - Functional and business logic failures where the app completes execution without crashing, but output validation fails (e.g., AssertionError, incorrect cart totals, promo code calculation mismatches).\n\n3. LOW SEVERITY / LOW PRIORITY:\n   - Infrastructure slowdowns, network timeouts (e.g., TimeoutException), element wait delays, or flaky UI selectors.\n\nINPUT DATA TO CLASSIFY:\nTest Case ID: {{ $json.output.test_case_id }}\nError Type: {{ $('Prepare').item.json.error_type }}\nFailing Component: {{ $json.output.failing_component }}\nFailure Domain: {{ $json.output.failure_domain }}\nExtracted Root Cause: {{ $json.output.extracted_root_cause }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        432,
        -32
      ],
      "id": "876dc1a9-c476-4cd7-98f4-2d5d04855813",
      "name": "Classify"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"test_case_id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"failing_component\": { \n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Component or service that failed (e.g., Mobile Checkout, Cart Engine, Store Finder UI)\"\n    },\n    \"failure_domain\": { \n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Domain category (e.g., Payment Gateway, Pricing Logic, Infrastructure/Timeout)\"\n    },\n    \"extracted_root_cause\": { \n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"One concise sentence explaining the exact technical failure from the stack trace.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"test_case_id\", \"failing_component\", \"failure_domain\", \"extracted_root_cause\"]\n}"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        192,
        192
      ],
      "id": "93b8d8d0-f207-4f7d-b742-d4b3027b1bc9",
